1
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:45,000
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,120
(This story is entirely fictional.
All settings are imaginary.)

3
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:49,240
=Episode 1=

4
00:01:35,439 --> 00:01:36,879
You're the one who killed Dashan?

5
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,640
(Three Months Earlier)

6
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,640
(My name is Zhou Yan.)

7
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,079
(Three months earlier,)

8
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,519
(to find Lin Sihan,
my girlfriend who disappeared,)

9
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,239
(I came to Langia,)

10
00:01:49,959 --> 00:01:51,319
(a place with no law)

11
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,480
(or order,)

12
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,120
(a living hell.)

13
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:03,599
Jeez, another war.

14
00:02:03,799 --> 00:02:05,159
Every single day.

15
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,480
(Fen, A Kin Seeker from Abroad)

16
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,199
Are you from Huaguo?

17
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:11,879
Looking for someone?

18
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:13,479
You too, ma'am?

19
00:02:16,039 --> 00:02:17,439
(MISSING)
This is my Wu.

20
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,879
He's been missing in Langia

21
00:02:19,199 --> 00:02:20,680
for years.

22
00:02:21,319 --> 00:02:22,439
I come to the police station every day,

23
00:02:22,919 --> 00:02:24,439
but they don't do anything at all.

24
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,719
Ma'am, you're pregnant
and still out here searching?

25
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:28,280
This one...

26
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:29,639
and Wu...

27
00:02:30,039 --> 00:02:31,240
are both my kids.

28
00:02:33,439 --> 00:02:33,719
Oh.

29
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,080
I just remembered a place.

30
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,800
Everyone there
is looking for someone.

31
00:02:37,039 --> 00:02:38,039
Someone there

32
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:39,000
might know your friend.

33
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,960
More eyes, better odds.

34
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:41,840
Come on. I'll take you there.

35
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,159
Let's go.

36
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:42,840
Really?

37
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:43,120
Yeah.

38
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:43,800
Thank you, ma'am.

39
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,120
Let's go. It's just ahead.

40
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,080
Right there.

41
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:51,439
Hey, buddy!

42
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:52,759
(Street Biker)
Where are you going?

43
00:02:52,879 --> 00:02:53,800
(Ma Ding)
Let me take you.

44
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:55,520
Fifty. That's cheap.

45
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:55,960
Hey.

46
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,000
We're together, both of us.

47
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,240
Huh?

48
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,080
No, thanks.

49
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:01,879
It's right there.

50
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,880
(Welcome to Langia)

51
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,000
We're going the same way.

52
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,879
All looking for someone.

53
00:03:13,199 --> 00:03:13,719
Hop in.

54
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:14,479
Okay.

55
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,320
(Welcome to Langia)

56
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:24,479
Oh no.

57
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,800
Another one falls for it.

58
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:43,840
Sir,

59
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:45,759
where are we going?

60
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,599
Sir, pull over.

61
00:03:59,479 --> 00:03:59,800
Sir!

62
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,599
Sir, pull over!

63
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:08,479
Stay put, piggy.

64
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:22,759
Get out.

65
00:04:24,439 --> 00:04:24,720
Move.

66
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:26,360
Over here.

67
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,240
Next.

68
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,080
(Dashan, One of Langia's Big Three)

69
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:40,639
Boss Dashan.

70
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:43,519
(Tujiu, Dashan's Henchman)
You told me to bring ten piggies.

71
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:44,879
With this one,

72
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,720
that's ten for today.

73
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:47,959
Nice.

74
00:05:49,639 --> 00:05:50,199
Give her a reward.

75
00:05:51,439 --> 00:05:52,439
I don't want money.

76
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,000
You said

77
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:55,759
if I brought you ten piggies,

78
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,879
you'd help me find Wu.

79
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,040
Did I say that?

80
00:06:00,199 --> 00:06:00,959
Did I, Tujiu?

81
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:03,519
See? Tujiu says no.

82
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:04,360
You did!

83
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,279
You really did!

84
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:06,759
You told me to bring ten

85
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:08,519
and you'll help me.

86
00:06:09,279 --> 00:06:10,040
Fine. I'll be nice.

87
00:06:10,519 --> 00:06:11,360
You've got ten now.

88
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,120
Bring me ninety more.

89
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:14,959
Make it a hundred.

90
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,720
I'll have Wu brought right over.

91
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:19,079
- I can't find that many.
- It's a deal.

92
00:06:19,079 --> 00:06:20,279
I can't find that many.

93
00:06:20,279 --> 00:06:20,639
Sir.

94
00:06:20,639 --> 00:06:21,279
- Please.
- Take her away.

95
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:22,000
I really can't.

96
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,120
Stop crying. What are you, a kid?

97
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,839
I really can't find that many.

98
00:06:24,319 --> 00:06:25,199
Hey. Pick up the money.

99
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,279
Hey.

100
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:36,879
She's as good-looking

101
00:06:37,079 --> 00:06:37,519
as me.

102
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:38,759
Oh.

103
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:40,399
Got a reaction.

104
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:40,720
Tujiu,

105
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:41,920
where's she going?

106
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,439
To Grand Royal.

107
00:06:45,319 --> 00:06:45,720
Right.

108
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:46,759
Whoa.

109
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,399
He's built like a tank.

110
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,920
Put him in the ring.

111
00:06:53,439 --> 00:06:54,240
Make him fight.

112
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,079
Beat him to death.

113
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,319
Quiet, will you?

114
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:05,160
I'm not done yet.

115
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:06,680
What about this one?

116
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:07,839
What do we do with him?

117
00:07:08,399 --> 00:07:09,079
Put him to work.

118
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:14,759
Did I say I was done?

119
00:07:17,319 --> 00:07:18,439
Go.

120
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,399
Not bad.

121
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:35,879
Come here.

122
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:40,600
What about this one?

123
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,240
Sir,

124
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,160
you got the wrong guy.

125
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,759
I'm here to find someone.

126
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,519
I have money. I can pay you.

127
00:07:51,839 --> 00:07:52,879
Just let me go.

128
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:54,399
Oh, you're rich, huh?

129
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:56,360
Don't you know? Here in Langia,

130
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,000
this...

131
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,160
this...

132
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,199
and...

133
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:01,199
this...

134
00:08:01,199 --> 00:08:02,879
are all worth a lot of money.

135
00:08:02,879 --> 00:08:03,519
Got it?

136
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:04,639
Tujiu.

137
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,600
Boss, don't take him away.

138
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,759
His blood type's a match.

139
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,319
Hey.

140
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,199
Come here!

141
00:08:17,199 --> 00:08:17,879
Lucky day! Lucky day!

142
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:19,399
Good deeds pay off.

143
00:08:20,639 --> 00:08:21,959
Today's your lucky day.

144
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:24,439
I've got a little gift for you.

145
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,160
How's that?

146
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:26,920
Surprised?

147
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:32,840
Take him upstairs.

148
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,120
Move.

149
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,039
Hurry.

150
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:41,240
Party time.

151
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:03,759
All set.

152
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:04,320
Boss.

153
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,440
These are all for clients.

154
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:07,879
Get them over there now.

155
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,200
Yes, sir. Right away.

156
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,160
(Suowen, One of Langia's Big Three)

157
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:31,919
You guys are...

158
00:09:32,879 --> 00:09:33,559
selling organs?

159
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,039
That... that's illegal.

160
00:09:38,639 --> 00:09:39,159
Oh, yeah?

161
00:09:40,799 --> 00:09:41,879
Then call the cops.

162
00:09:46,879 --> 00:09:47,679
(Greetings.)

163
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:51,360
(Boss Suowen.)

164
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,159
(Good deeds pay off.)

165
00:09:53,879 --> 00:09:56,320
(I finally found you a matching heart.)

166
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:58,279
(See how much)

167
00:09:58,879 --> 00:09:59,720
(I care about you?)

168
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:05,039
Do it right.

169
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:07,200
Handle my heart carefully.

170
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:42,679
Pin him down.

171
00:10:49,799 --> 00:10:50,679
Hurry! Hurry!

172
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,240
Boss Suowen!

173
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:21,159
What is it?

174
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,639
He got away!

175
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,240
Quick! After him!

176
00:12:11,559 --> 00:12:12,240
Where'd he go?

177
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:13,960
Don't make a sound,

178
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:14,919
or I'll...

179
00:12:18,039 --> 00:12:18,720
Don't worry.

180
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,320
Once they're gone,

181
00:12:21,799 --> 00:12:22,799
I'll let you go.

182
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:24,720
Hmm.

183
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,520
(Mona, Nurse)

184
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,120
Are you from Huaguo?

185
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:30,399
Yeah.

186
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:33,159
You escaped from the basement?

187
00:12:33,639 --> 00:12:34,720
What happened down there?

188
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:37,399
They're running an illegal organ trade
down there.

189
00:12:38,039 --> 00:12:38,960
An illegal organ trade?

190
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,919
Aren't you a nurse here?

191
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,240
You didn't know?

192
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:43,600
Oh.

193
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,240
I just started today.

194
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:48,559
Don't move.

195
00:12:51,399 --> 00:12:52,799
Search every room.

196
00:13:13,159 --> 00:13:13,519
Boss.

197
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,399
We checked them all. No one's there.

198
00:13:20,799 --> 00:13:21,480
Wait.

199
00:13:36,559 --> 00:13:37,559
He's in this room.

200
00:13:37,559 --> 00:13:38,679
Check every cabinet.

201
00:13:38,679 --> 00:13:39,240
Go!

202
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,840
♪Dust rises along the border♪

203
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,160
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

204
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:21,520
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

205
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:22,920
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

206
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:24,280
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

207
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:25,600
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

208
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:26,920
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

209
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:28,600
♪My life is mine to bear♪

210
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:31,440
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

211
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:34,040
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

212
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:36,360
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

213
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,440
♪My fate is mine to command♪

214
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:38,720
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

215
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,000
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

216
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,320
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

217
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:42,600
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

218
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:43,960
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

219
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:45,280
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

220
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,600
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

221
00:14:46,800 --> 00:14:47,880
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

222
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:49,240
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

223
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:50,760
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

224
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:52,160
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

225
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,520
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

226
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:56,560
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

227
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,240
♪With blood and sweat♪

228
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:01,640
♪I forge my glory♪

229
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,040
♪In this world of chaos♪

230
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:04,120
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

231
00:15:04,160 --> 00:15:05,600
♪My legend♪

232
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,080
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

233
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:14,240
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

234
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:17,080
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

235
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:19,200
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

236
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,480
♪My fate is mine to command♪

237
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:21,760
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

238
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,040
♪My fate is mine to command♪

239
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,800
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪
